  <data name="FindCompanion_Information" xml:space="preserve">
	<value>&lt;h2&gt;Find Companion Page&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This page lets you search for potential connections by selecting specific criteria that match your preferences. Use the filters to narrow down results and discover people who are nearby in your demographic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Top-ranked users appear first in the search results. To connect, simply click &lt;strong&gt;Send Message&lt;/strong&gt; to start a conversation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;After you click &lt;strong&gt;Send Message&lt;/strong&gt;, you may ask &lt;strong&gt;CompanioNita&lt;/strong&gt; to help you compose your initial message.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Happy connecting!&lt;/p&gt;</value>
  </data>
